WEBVTT

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:04.850
Any word from Kyouno and the others?

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:07.060
No, nothing yet.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.360
Those girls...

00:00:09.360 --> 00:00:11.740
Don't they know the position they're in?!

00:00:11.740 --> 00:00:14.410
Regardless of what we say,

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.990
the Le Garite ship is out of our jurisdiction.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:21.910
All we can do is pray for their safety.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.960
The chips they serve here for the princess are amazing.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.970
Even the salt on them tastes different!

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:36.720
"Good morning, chatty little bird!"

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.560
"And also to you honey bee, full of energy!"{lol}

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:41.390
"Hurry and tell him that I am here."

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:46.020
"Tell the prince who's been searching for me that I am here."

00:00:46.020 --> 00:00:47.810
"A very sweet maple syrup pie is..."{gross}

00:00:52.740 --> 00:00:55.700
<i>I thought I hid all my poetry journals.</i>

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.780
Hey, I can't see!

00:00:57.780 --> 00:01:00.120
Move it, "maple syrup pie".

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:00.910
Come on!

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:05.210
You didn't come on board just to ransack my room, did you?!

00:01:05.210 --> 00:01:09.460
We're just waiting for you to get him to open that door.

00:01:09.460 --> 00:01:09.920
Huh?

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:15.380
Your brother's the only one who can open that room, right?

00:01:15.840 --> 00:01:17.300
Right...

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.220
If Miss Yurikano's on board too, isn't that the only place she could be?

00:01:21.220 --> 00:01:21.890
Yeah...

00:01:21.890 --> 00:01:22.770
In that case...

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:24.890
You're scared, aren't you?

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:28.060
Scared? You mean about the whole asylum deal?

00:01:28.060 --> 00:01:30.150
There's that, but also...

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:32.650
He really didn't tell you?

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.990
About Miss Yurikano being on this ship?

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:39.160
I didn't even know she was alive.

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:50.500
Ladies, if you would please come with me.

