00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:25.010
Oh wow, what's this for?!

00:03:29.310 --> 00:03:31.100
My brother arranged this?

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:36.060
In Orbit Above the Summer Skies of Kamogawa

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:36.110
I've wanted to thank the two of you for some time now.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:40.150
Miss Madoka, in spite of being unaccustomed to aliens,

00:03:40.650 --> 00:03:43.950
you accepted my younger sister warmly.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:48.490
And Miss Muginami, you have put aside the differences

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:53.370
between our two nations to befriend my sister.

00:03:53.920 --> 00:04:00.380
I would like to express my deepest gratitude today.

00:04:01.760 --> 00:04:02.630
Thank you.

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:05.760
Brother...

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:09.060
But enough with the boring formalities.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.610
Laffinty really did that?

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:24.950
Yes.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:27.620
I told her she should put on undergarments, but...

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:29.240
next thing you know, it rained.

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:33.160
Her blouse clung to her, and you could see everything.

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:36.460
Hey, this might be our chance—

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:36.460
Lan would've looked sexier if she'd been naked...

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.090
Ask him.

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:38.540
When it comes to wearing wet clothes,

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:40.880
Lan would be number one!

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:41.630
Fine...

00:04:42.170 --> 00:04:44.420
Don't you agree, Madoka?!

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:48.510
Excuse me... But can we see Miss Yurikano?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:56.100
We came on board because we had some questions for her.

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.440
Questions?

00:04:57.440 --> 00:04:59.230
Actually, we have some for you too.

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:00.860
Like what?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:05.490
Why did you keep it a secret from Lan that Miss Yurikano was on this ship?

00:05:05.490 --> 00:05:06.740
Madoka!

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.450
The incident on Militia Zodia brought us a second tragedy.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:17.830
Yurikano was rescued from that destruction,

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:21.500
but she emerged a completely different person.

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.260
She had no memories of me, Laffinty,

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:28.010
or even of her real brother, Villagiulio.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:33.470
I didn't want you to see her like that.

00:05:33.470 --> 00:05:38.400
I felt I should wait until the Yurikano we once knew returned.

00:05:38.400 --> 00:05:44.150
But if my overprotectiveness has hurt you,

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:47.070
I apologize, Laffinty.

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.070
Brother...

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:52.240
Yurikano is resting right now.

00:05:52.700 --> 00:05:55.910
I'd appreciate it if you could wait to see her some other time.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.840
Maybe the reason behind your two brothers not getting along

00:06:02.840 --> 00:06:07.010
has more to do with Big Brother Giuvi's personality.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:08.630
That's not true!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.430
You think so?

00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:14.060
But Lan's brother was so different from what I had in mind.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:15.020
Huh?

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:17.600
He's gentlemanly and kindhearted...

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.640
the exact opposite of Big Brother Giuvi.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:22.650
That doesn't make everything <i>my</i> brother's fault!

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:25.480
But you don't deny that he <i>is</i> the exact opposite.

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.610
Well, what're we going to do now?

00:06:30.610 --> 00:06:33.240
He wants us to wait to see Miss Yurikano some other time.

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:36.330
But it means we can see her eventually.

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:40.540
Let's wait in Lan's room until Miss Yurikano's well enough to see us.

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:44.800
We might even find more fun stuff in there.

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:48.670
Muginami, what about you?

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:53.260
Did meeting my brother change your impression?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.220
I'm sorry, Lan.

00:06:56.260 --> 00:06:57.430
That's all right.

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.810
Oh, Madoka!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.900
What do you want to wear to bed? Pajamas or a nightie?

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.820
Huh? Madoka?

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:20.460
Um...

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:26.090
Where am I?

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:34.010
I'm sorry. I didn't know this was your private garden.

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.470
Don't worry about it.

00:07:35.890 --> 00:07:38.770
I had this place made to the exact specifications

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.980
of the royal garden on my home planet.

00:07:41.640 --> 00:07:44.270
We played here a lot when we were little.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.940
Myself, Laffinty, Villagiulio...

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:49.940
And... Yurikano.

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:52.320
Hey...

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:58.410
Do you think you guys could be friends again like you used to be?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:07:59.410
With Big Brother Giuvi?

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:04.080
I still consider him my one and only best friend.

00:08:04.080 --> 00:08:05.040
Then why?!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:06.590
But at the same time,

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:09.800
the people of Polyhedron are my family, and I must protect them.

00:08:14.680 --> 00:08:17.300
"Life is a miracle in itself."

00:08:19.390 --> 00:08:23.890
{}Eons ago, when the first tragedy befell Earth,

00:08:23.890 --> 00:08:28.360
{}our ancestors barely managed to escape and survive.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:32.440
{}Their indomitable will has been passed down to us in the present day.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:36.660
{}But, there are many who take that for granted.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:39.830
{}One of whom... is Villagiulio.

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:46.080
{}If it means saving all these miracles of life,

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:49.840
{}then I am willing to make whatever sacrifices are necessary.

00:08:51.000 --> 00:08:52.920
{}Do I seem obstinate to you?

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:55.180
{}Huh? Well, uh...

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:56.760
Huh?

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.350
I'll take you to Yurikano.

00:09:05.640 --> 00:09:07.900
Guerilla attack or not...

00:09:08.360 --> 00:09:11.070
I must protest against a solitary raid!

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:15.700
As I keep telling you, this war is between Dizel and myself!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:19.200
There's no guarantee he'd also see it that way.

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.240
Oh, he will.

00:09:21.240 --> 00:09:25.790
It's the only way to explain why he would make such a cheap taunt.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:31.880
I've just been told that everything's all set for her to speak with you.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:36.300
But I want to see Miss Yurikano alone...

00:09:54.190 --> 00:09:55.150
Come in.

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.530
Huh? Uh...

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:59.490
What's the matter? Don't be shy.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:04.200
What is this place?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:09.960
Lady Yurikano is over here.

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:17.840
We've been waiting for you.

00:10:18.130 --> 00:10:20.510
Welcome, Miss Madoka.

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:36.070
Lan, you looked like a cute doll when you were little.

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.570
How many times have I told you not to go through my things!

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.780
When the day comes that Brother is able

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:48.710
to be with Yurikano like they used to...

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:51.790
You're not her substitute, Muginami.

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:57.050
She wasn't as mean as you are.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:06.640
I hope one day, you can all smile together like this again.

00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:09.520
When that day comes, we'll take another photo together.

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:11.690
This time with you and Madoka in it.

00:11:14.190 --> 00:11:16.230
What's keeping Madoka?

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:21.490
I told my attendants to bring her here when they find her.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:25.080
Maybe your brother caught her.

00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:29.200
You don't think...

00:11:29.200 --> 00:11:30.040
Wait!

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:53.770
What is all of this?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:59.820
<i>Unfortunately, by the time we rescued Yurikano from the Tragedy of Militia Zodia,</i>

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:05.120
<i>the majority of her memories and consciousness was left behind on the other side of Rin-ne.</i>

00:12:05.120 --> 00:12:05.950
Rin-ne...

00:12:06.570 --> 00:12:08.950
<i>Don't worry.</i>

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:11.120
<i>All you have to do is accept it.</i>

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:13.290
Okay...

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:17.290
I never expected her to come from her side.

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:22.720
Some good will come from Yurikano going down to Pharos.

00:12:23.510 --> 00:12:26.470
We will embed Madoka Kyouno's mind into Yurikano's empty shell.

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:30.720
Now we can destroy De Metrio even without the use of Vox Aura.

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:36.230
We will not have to extinguish the hundred billion miracles that light up Polyhedron.

00:12:36.230 --> 00:12:43.110
However, Miss Madoka will never be able to extract herself from Lady Yurikano's body.

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:44.490
I will shoulder her hatred...

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:50.160
along with those of De Metrio.

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:56.370
Miss Kyouno is with His Majesty in the Deep Level Experiment Division.

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:02.920
Princess, I cannot allow anyone to interfere. Not even you.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:04.420
Oh, that's perfect.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.640
Now, restrain Muginami immediately.

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:10.180
Lan?!

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.600
Are you sure, my lady?

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:14.480
If Madoka is already in our hands,

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:17.400
I no longer need to pretend to protect this woman.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.610
Lan, was this your plan from the very start?

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:22.110
Lan?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:28.240
Please! Let me talk to Madoka!{gross monster tits}

00:13:28.240 --> 00:13:29.490
Quit your nagging!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.790
How could you, Lan?!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:36.160
Lan!

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:41.670
Princess, you've finally come to understand His Majesty's anguish.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:47.430
I've caused Brother and everyone in the fleet unnecessary grief.

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:53.220
Allow me to express my deep appreciation and words of encouragement to everyone.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:56.430
Your kind consideration touches us deeply.

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:01.900
Space Field Barriers 6 through 4,230 have been sealed.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:03.980
Sighting light-time stable.

00:14:03.980 --> 00:14:06.360
Preparatory rotation of USHV Ring complete.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.820
Connection in three, two...

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:10.820
Now connecting.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.740
She'll be on her way soon.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:20.040
Will I be able to see my friends again?

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.250
<i>Why do you ask?</i>

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:23.380
I just had this feeling...

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.010
Trust me.

00:14:28.970 --> 00:14:30.300
<i>All right, then...</i>

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.720
<i>Give my regards to Yurikano.</i>

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:32.970
I will!

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:38.270
To the valiant crew aboard

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:41.310
the Galaxy Expeditionary Force Flagship, "Vishwak",

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:45.280
and to the troops who served aboard the other ships of our fleet

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.780
with fearless courage, whether day or night...

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:48.570
I...

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:52.910
<i>Fin E Ld Si Laffinty, Princess of Le Garite,</i>

00:14:52.910 --> 00:14:57.910
<i>take this opportunity to respectfully offer my sincerest appreciation.</i>

00:14:58.830 --> 00:15:02.420
<i>To our flag, senior, and junior officers</i>

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:06.050
<i>who have led our fleet and our troops on the path to invincibility,</i>

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:09.420
<i>I offer my heartfelt gratitude and future glory...</i>

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:11.090
<i>And to our enlisted troops,</i> {timing check}

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:14.050
<i>with your exemplary tactical combat skills...</i>

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.430
<i>Let me talk to Madoka!</i>

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:18.020
<i>Quit your nagging!</i>

00:15:18.470 --> 00:15:21.230
<i>I offer my heartfelt gratitude and future glory.</i>

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:24.650
Synchronous waveform stable, convergence completed.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:27.070
Mental Detachment has been initiated.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.660
So far, so good.

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:43.710
And to Hana, the stray cat down on 3rd street

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:45.670
that brought me immense comfort...

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.960
I offer many thanks and future glory.

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:46.920
Hana?

00:15:47.960 --> 00:15:52.010
And... oh yes!

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.220
To Mr. Hiroshi from BWH,

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:56.220
who removed the carrots I hated from my plate

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.220
without anyone knowing,

00:15:58.220 --> 00:15:59.850
I offer many thanks and future glory!

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:03.230
<i>Also... um...</i>

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:08.820
<i>And...lest I forget...</i>

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:08.820
We'll be returning to our duties...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:11.690
<i>The casual sprinkle of diced green peppers...</i>

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:15.700
<i>The not-too-thick, not-too-thin homemade salami with the fine taste.</i>

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:18.870
<i>Mr. Hiroshi's special BWH pizza!</i>

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:21.160
<i>Come to think of it...</i>

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:25.880
<i>The day before yesterday, I had the oddest dream</i>

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:28.130
<i>that my left and right nostrils had switched places!</i>

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:29.800
Atta girl, Lan. Hang in there!

00:16:28.130 --> 00:16:28.920
<i>Now that I think about it,</i>

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.710
<i>it was so unrecognizable that I'm surprised I even noticed it!</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:35.010
Six, seven...

00:16:35.010 --> 00:16:37.050
Bisgarbo count exceeding point eight!

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:43.060
I never expected her to go this far.

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:46.230
Incredible! This girl is truly incredible!

00:16:48.060 --> 00:16:51.690
And, there's um...

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:56.490
Tweet, tweet, tweet, little early bird.

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:58.660
Tweet, tweet, tweet, listen to it sing.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:02.160
<i>Good morning, my beloved prince. Tweet, tweet, tweet.</i>

00:17:03.200 --> 00:17:04.750
Condition stable.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:06.250
She's past the limit point!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:14.590
If all goes well, Lady Yurikano and Madoka Kyouno will merge into one.

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:32.190
After connecting the nerve cutter to the consciousness strata,

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.900
the ego barrier will be automatically excised.

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:37.450
Set startup to engage at the count of 17.

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:40.580
"Auto startup" — All termination directives will be ignored.

00:17:42.870 --> 00:17:45.620
This is it. This is how it should be.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.790
Goodbye, Brother...

00:17:51.790 --> 00:17:52.750
Dizel...

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:17.900
Why did you do that?

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:23.790
As long as I disappear off into the Rin-ne and close off its entrance,

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:25.660
it will prevent my brother and Dizel from fighting.

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:30.460
It was the only thing I could do.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:34.800
In order to ensure peace to the Polyhedron for the coming millennium,

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:38.630
Dizel attempted to use my power to wipe out De Metrio.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:42.100
Lan's brother tried to do such a terrible thing?

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.930
It's easy to blame Dizel.

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:50.100
But the real evil is me, who possessed such malevolent power.

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:51.690
Don't say that!

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:56.150
And if I'm to stop a king from fighting to save his people...

00:18:56.150 --> 00:19:00.360
Then it is my responsibility as a princess to fulfill that mission in his place.

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.740
Thank you for coming to see me.

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:09.910
Do those two know about this?

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:13.710
That you're shouldering the entire burden alone?

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:14.880
It doesn't matter.

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:17.880
This is the decision I made on my own.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:21.380
But it wasn't something you really wanted to do, was it?

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.140
Let's go and tell them.

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:28.140
That way, they might change their minds.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.520
It's fine.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.730
No, it's not!

00:19:32.600 --> 00:19:34.810
Hello! Lan's brother?!

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:35.690
Moid!

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.980
Bring me and Miss Yurikano back to the real world right now!

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:38.570
Stop it!

00:19:38.570 --> 00:19:42.610
Why?! The two of them haven't stopped fighting yet!

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.990
I said I'm fine, so just accept it!

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.660
You don't leave me any choice.

00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:53.040
I'll make you tell them, even if I have to force you to!

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:58.840
I don't want to.

00:19:58.840 --> 00:19:59.920
There are some things I don't want to tell them!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.260
Now I'm getting fired up.

00:20:06.100 --> 00:20:07.890
All right, no matter what...

00:20:08.220 --> 00:20:09.390
No matter what...

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.900
I'll make you tell them!

00:20:15.770 --> 00:20:17.900
I'll never tell them!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.940
Madoka!

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:23.240
Madoka!

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:30.120
I'd like to close with these words:

00:20:30.620 --> 00:20:35.370
<i>I, Princess Laffinty, fervently hope that our nation and De Metrio</i>

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:40.130
<i>will move forward into the next millennium hand in hand.</i>

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:45.050
You put one over on us, didn't you, Princess?

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:49.930
I only did what I believed was right as princess.

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:04.700
Something seems to be wrong with Dizelmine's ship!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.160
<i>Something's happening to the exterior!</i>

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:09.240
