00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:25.970
Miss Yurikano?

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:29.180
Madoka, what're you waiting for?!

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.390
We have to run!

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:35.350
