00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:39.440
Cap! Aura and the other Voxes, they're...

00:21:39.440 --> 00:21:41.610
<i>Catapult deck opening!</i>

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:41.980
<i>We can't override their T.O. sequences!</i>

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:42.940
